	(text_box "J1: 12S Cell Sense Input (CELL0 = Cell 1−, CELL12 = Cell 12+)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 13.335 13.5524 0)
		(size 26.67 8.0376)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "2f1423bc-09a7-4471-afe8-22525789b6e9")
	)
	(text_box "S-ADC BALANCING, REDUNDANT SENSE & CLAMP (12S6P)\n- 12 channels (S12P/N-S1P/N): 2x 15R (0.5W, 1206) + 0.22uF diff RC filter (fc ~24.1kHz).\n- Dual role: Redundant voltage check when idle; passive balancing (~127mA, ~0.24W/res)\n  via internal ADBMS6830B FETs when active.\n- D11-D15 (BAV70) on Cells 8-12 steer spikes to Clamp -> D16 (SMBJ58A) -> V-."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 157.48 169.6362 0)
		(size 67.31 18.9588)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "385bd480-7df3-4b9d-80f3-c5bdfe7f5e2f")
	)
	(text_box "BLOCK 1: RAW CELL-TAP EMI FALLBACK (DNI)\n- 13 taps (CELL12 = Stack Top +; CELL0 = Stack Bottom -, 0V/V-).\n- 12 caps (C12-C1) across each adjacent cell (C12: CELL12-CELL11 ... C1: CELL1-CELL0)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 51.435 13.7686 0)
		(size 88.265 14.1714)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "59902611-5132-4d6a-81f6-788947058566")
	)
	(text_box "D16 (SMBJ58A):\nShared ESD/surge clamp for BAV70 steering diodes. GND = isolated module V-.\nLAYOUT: Place near J1/BAV70 rail with a short, wide trace to V- pour."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 12.7 78.74 0)
		(size 27.94 20.3053)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9f0264c7-0594-4b87-99fa-1100b9581fdb")
	)
	(text_box "5V VREG Regulator\n- Q1 (MJD31CAJ): External NPN pass transistor driven by DRIVE to generate 5V VREG\n- C81 (10uF): Collector input decoupling capacitor\n- R71 (10Ω): Base series damping resistor for loop stability\n- L1 (Ferrite): High-frequency noise filter on VREG output"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 266.7 29.72 0)
		(size 36.195 22.35)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c373f9ef-04cb-415a-bcd3-e970f2176165")
	)
	(text_box "C90-C101:\nStacked S-ADC differential filter ladder (Cells 1-12).\nBottom ties to isolated module V- (CELL0), NOT chassis/LV GND.\nLAYOUT: Place close to U1 SxP pins."
